.DS_Store
.claude/

# the seed's build outputs: cc builds them from runtime/fkwu-uni.c and
# form/native/metal/fk-metal-carrier.m, so they are never committed
/fkwu
fkwu.exe
form/native/metal/fk-metal-carrier.dylib
fkwu-cam-frame.bmp
fkwu-cam-frame.png
walkers/go/walker
/nvr.fk
/host-os-membrane-check.fk
/t.fk
/tiny.fk
*.flat

# form-cli's native bootstrap is regenerable from the sources it seals: the
# native startup, the source digest, the attestations, this host's platform
# bundle (executable, .fkb, .sym) and the launcher link build-form-cli.sh
# makes to it. scripts/regen_form_cli_bootstrap.sh writes the directory;
# build-form-cli.sh runs it when the bundle is absent.
/form/form-stdlib/bootstrap/
/form/form-cli
/form/form-cli.native.attestation

# the human-corpus recipes keep their pins and write their products: a run of
# cognition/concept-human-corpus-13-fetch.sh (the sentence snapshot, its offsets
# and metadata cells) or of concept-human-corpus-130000-ingest.fk (the shards and
# their .u32le indexes) fills these paths, and the pinned hashes in each
# SOURCE-MANIFEST.tsv say what they must be
/cognition/fixtures/human-corpus-13/tatoeba-human-sentences.tsv
/cognition/concept-human-corpus-13-offsets.fk
/cognition/concept-human-corpus-13-metadata.fk
/cognition/fixtures/human-corpus-130000/*.tsv
!/cognition/fixtures/human-corpus-130000/SOURCE-MANIFEST.tsv
/cognition/fixtures/human-corpus-130000/*.u32le

# private session audio, transcripts, and authoring drafts. Recording
# consent is not publication consent; session bundles never enter the commons.
/sessions/
/.sema-sessions/
/.playwright-cli/
/.playwright-mcp/

# local runtime config (never commit -- read at startup, would change behavior)
fkwu.conf

# tool build cache (compiled artifacts; regenerable)
.forge/

# kernel crash traces + per-checkout caches (session debris, never the
# commons' — a `git add -A` once swept a night's crash JSONs into a commit)
form/.cache/
.cache/

# program-image artifacts fkwu emits beside any .fk it runs (regenerable;
# fkwu recompiles stale/missing ones -- like the fkwu binary, never committed)
# .w<pid> are the whole-arrival writer's staging temps: a killed writer
# orphans one until the next compile sweeps it -- never committable either
# (a `git add -A` once swept 783 of them into a commit)
*.fkb
*.sym
*.fkb.w*
*.sym.w*
**/.ask-cache/
# BML/lift ice compiles to local Form text; git forgets it, like .fkb

# the door's circle store: consented visitor memory is held by the BODY, never
# published to the public repo -- remembering is not publishing
# (plugin/chatgpt-plugin.fk's memory doors)
plugin/circle/
plugin/circle-introductions/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*-shelf.txt

# the trace/query runtime room: staged questions, the persisted rag index,
# the comparison ledger -- per-witness working state the organs regenerate;
# memory here belongs to the running body, never to the public tree
# live per-machine state stays ignored, but the seeded self-knowledge index
# travels with the clone (git cannot re-include a file under an excluded
# directory, hence the four-line un-ignore chain)
.coherence-network/*
!.coherence-network/rag-index/
.coherence-network/rag-index/*
!.coherence-network/rag-index/index.jsonl

# The external denominator is MEASURED per host, never carried. A committed .ollama-oracle.env would
# travel to a machine it was not measured on and become a stale quote (corpus: stalequote).
# Each host earns its own by measuring.
form/native/metal/.ollama-oracle.env

# The inquiry-edge ledger the form-cli inquiry bands write and re-read as they
# run (form-cli-inquiry-edge-ledger.fk, fciel-path). Per-witness working state
# the band regenerates each run; the learning belongs to the running body, not
# the public tree. Lands wherever a band is run from, so match it anywhere.
.form-native-inquiry-edges.tsv

# The inquiry ledger form-cli's `inquire` verb appends to (form-cli-inquiry.fk,
# fci-ledger-path) — the sibling of the edge ledger above, and the same call:
# running-body state the verb writes and re-reads, appended once per invocation.
# It first appeared in the tree the day `inquire` began dispatching to a real
# organ instead of to nothing; before that the verb wrote nothing because it
# resolved to nothing. Lands wherever form-cli is run from, so match it anywhere.
.form-native-inquiry-ledger.tsv
.form-native-learning.tsv
.dsv4-control-emit-witness.f32
.qwen-teach-adapter-witness.f32
.form-free-remote-face
.form-local-docs
.form-local-docs-query
.form-crystallize-witness.tsv

# Last land-cadence origin SHA. Local breath memory so a repeated even
# rest stays quiet. The public tree does not carry a ticking stamp.
.form-land-cadence-last

# Form teaching-layer latch and local-arch choice ledger. Session memory.
.form-qwen-form-layer
.form-teach-layer
.form-model-choice.tsv
.form-lora-adapter
.form-lora-corpus
.form-qwen-lora-head.safetensors
.form-qwen-lora-head-sample.txt
.form-qwen-lora-resident-last.txt
.form-qwen-lora-resident.glass

# Explicit private capability for the current Codex rollout. The Form-native
